        <div class="case-walkthrough">
          <div><p><strong>Noor, score 0.68, actually failed:</strong> at the starting 0.50 threshold this is a <strong>false positive</strong>. If wrongly predicting success is costly, prioritize <strong>precision</strong>.</p></div>
