        <div class="statml-deepening"><span class="content-kicker">From case to action</span><p>Threshold changes only the decision rule; it does not repair weak features, biased labels, or poor calibration. Inspect concrete errors, diagnose the cause, change the appropriate part, then evaluate again by relevant groups.</p></div>
